{arial}Decoding: Chief Barkod


from: {arialbld}Kurt Rorscham{arial}

Schyzo Encampment of Eizenwald








Junction has been made with Alex Kolman, the 1st Normo Army has taken over here. That old fox Alex lost no time sealing off the area, nobody can approach within 3km of Ratmüde without an AUSWEISS signed from his own hand. He must be worried about paper flying away cause of air drafts, for sure our own eggheads are craving for having an eye on those Psycho rocket-aircraft stuff.{pause}

Anyway they're not airplanes, those bloody things with little wings on the sides are flying bombs capable of sending a load of 500kg over 300km! These blasted contraptions don't even have a cockpit, they fly without a pilot!{pause}












{center}{device43}












{pause}If you want to know what I think {name}, the world's going to hell in a hand-basket.{pause}

There's no question I'd have rather been born two centuries ago, to lead the final cavalry charge in a battle lost beforehand, flying like the wind across the battlefield torn by artillery fire, emerging from the smoke of explosions, roaring sword in hand, like a super being inspiring fear and admiration.{pause}

Instead we have to fight against a bunch of button-pushing perverts hiding in some cellar. If there's nothing left but machines without pilots, then there are no more men, then without men there are no more heroes, and a life without heroes is like a rodeo without a cowboy, like a ball without musicians...{pause}


But where am I going, we have a mission to complete:{pause}


{ia7}{offset100}Magnus Von Tekton has fortified his capital Tektona and ordered his sons to defend the city at any cost, this egoistic and demonic madman has forbidden his children from surviving his own downfall.{pause}

This campaign henceforth no longer concerns the young Markus Boggus, but Sakharin, you {name} and I have a date with this sicko who's taking things out on the whole planet.{offset0}




{offset150}Chief of the 3rd Schyzo Army

{arialbld}Kurt Rorscham{arial}



